# Bridge transfer staging area. The Linux session stages task archives here
# for the Windows session to apply; it is never repository content. Committed
# once by accident (T-11, 2026-09-02) and removed; this keeps it out.
_to_delete/

# Cowork/Claude writes session outputs here — delivered artifacts, transfer
# archives, and frozen copies of documents that live in the repo already.
# Never repository content: a stale copy of tasks/progress.html committed from
# here would become a sixth scoreboard that nothing gates, which is the exact
# defect the scoreboard exists to hunt. Offered for commit by GitHub Desktop
# on 2026-09-04 and declined; this keeps it out.
Claude outputs/
